    {
      "id": 32584,
      "nameEs": "Wild Arms 5",
      "originalName": "Wild Arms 5",
      "year": 2006,
      "igdbId": 1682,
      "popularity": 10,
      "iconic": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "best_version",
          "value": "81374",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "name_es",
          "value": "Wild Arms 5",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Wild Arms 5",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Developed for the 10th anniversary of the series, Wild Arms 5 follows a group of young travelers as they fight for their dying land. Players guide the rag-tag bunch of heroes through a 3D world full of adventure and combat. While jumping, sliding, and stomping through the environment to complete the main objective, gamers can also engage in mini-games and side quests for money and rare items. Although the story revolves around new characters, the HEX battle system returns and several known avatars make cameo appearances during the game. Duel-pistol wielding skills make their debut in Wild Arms 5, and allow gamers to shoot different bullets that solve puzzles located throughout the adventure.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Desarrollado con motivo del décimo aniversario de la serie, Wild Arms 5 sigue a un grupo de jóvenes viajeros que luchan por su tierra moribunda. Los jugadores guían al variopinto grupo de héroes por un mundo 3D lleno de aventuras y combates. Mientras saltan, se deslizan y pisotean el entorno para completar el objetivo principal, también pueden participar en minijuegos y misiones secundarias para obtener dinero y objetos raros. Aunque la historia gira en torno a personajes nuevos, el sistema de batalla HEX regresa y varios personajes conocidos aparecen como cameos durante el juego. Las habilidades con pistolas dobles debutan en Wild Arms 5 y permiten disparar distintos tipos de balas que resuelven los puzles repartidos por la aventura.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
